        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To complement our deposit offerings, we also provide treasury solutions, merchant services, and other financial tools that support businesses in managing cash flow and operational efficiency.",
        "start_character": 2844,
        "end_character": 3035
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer wealth management, consumer insurance, internet banking services, electronic bill payment services, safe deposit box rentals, telephone banking, credit and debit card services, remote depository products and access to a network of ATMs to our customers.",
        "start_character": 3036,
        "end_character": 3303
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In particular, we are required to include management and independent registered public accounting firm reports on internal controls as part of our Annual Report on Form 10-K in order to comply with Section 404 of the Sarbanes-Oxley Act.",
        "start_character": 23672,
        "end_character": 23908
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate locations throughout Georgia as well as in Birmingham, Alabama, and Jacksonville, Santa Rosa Beach and Tallahassee, Florida.",
        "start_character": 699,
        "end_character": 834
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As a financial holding company, we are permitted to engage directly or indirectly in a broader range of activities than those permitted for a bank holding company that has not elected to be a financial holding company.",
        "start_character": 17319,
        "end_character": 17537
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As such, we are subject to comprehensive supervision and regulation by the Federal Reserve and are subject to its regulatory reporting requirements.",
        "start_character": 16456,
        "end_character": 16604
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "In addition, we are also subject to federal regulatory capital requirements that effectively limit the amount of cash dividends that we may pay.",
        "start_character": 36158,
        "end_character": 36302
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "In contrast to our rural markets, in which we typically rank in the top three in terms of market share, we face competitive pressures in attracting deposits and making loans from larger regional banks and smaller community banks.",
        "start_character": 6500,
        "end_character": 6729
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are a legal entity separate and distinct from the Bank and our other subsidiaries.",
        "start_character": 35528,
        "end_character": 35613
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are extensively regulated under federal and state law.",
        "start_character": 14744,
        "end_character": 14801
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are registered as a bank holding company with the Federal Reserve under the Bank Holding Company Act of 1956, as amended (the “BHC Act”) and have elected to be treated as a financial holding company.",
        "start_character": 16253,
        "end_character": 16455
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000711669-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000711669-26-000007-bf2431dc02d629b4",
        "accession_number": "0000711669-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are required to comply with various corporate governance and financial reporting requirements under the Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002, as well as rules and regulations adopted by the SEC, the Public Company Accounting Oversight Board, and the New York Stock Exchange.",
        "start_character": 23404,
        "end_character": 23671
      }
